{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026SUEmsc5t941794797995.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《中年好聲音2》冠軍古淖文（German）推出今年的第二首單曲《還想我嗎》。今次German一改以往的型格跳唱風格，轉而挑戰苦情慢歌路線，更特意邀請老友羅力威親自操刀作曲，以深情唱腔展現出不同一面。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9816ef53-1a97-4f70-af2d-00b08cb273aa.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Z5sGjE7pfn1794797995.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新歌MV講述一對情侶分手後復合失敗的虐心愛情故事。German接受TVB娛樂新聞台獨家訪問時透露：「其實男主角係想同前度箍煲，但係失敗」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"57ab9370-989e-4896-b06a-3db0e74e41b4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Yc7DJzt4jx1794797995.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>TVB娛樂新聞台</p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9bd6c0fe-aefd-4195-b345-c3eea6530404.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026UhC9RDPufP1794797995.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>TVB娛樂新聞台</p></p><h3></h3><p>談及拍攝過程，German笑言雖然在拍攝時才與MV女主角第一次見面，但兩人反而完全不需要刻意培養默契：「雖然大家啱啱識，但係我哋兩個好自然做到嗰個效果！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.355292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:41.497881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:27.296171+00:00","content_hash":"081dd6cb8809b712243ccad9c15ecc35ccfc024fdae661273d8db565efa65dba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.355292+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}